{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROGOLF is an upcoming rogue-lite, where you play mini-golf, buy equipment and get points based on your collected coins &amp; remaining shots. You'll have to have enough accumulated points to go through each Gates, and reach the top !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game is different and each levels have its own rules ! You'll have to trade your tees for items that will change the course of your run !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/8fa65b85aa0829e75c1fa2ddb743b277.poster.avif?t=1774433595\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/8fa65b85aa0829e75c1fa2ddb743b277.webm?t=1774433595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/8fa65b85aa0829e75c1fa2ddb743b277.mp4?t=1774433595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Mini Golf</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/c04d8dd864061424b08d686502c36054.poster.avif?t=1774433595\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/c04d8dd864061424b08d686502c36054.webm?t=1774433595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/c04d8dd864061424b08d686502c36054.mp4?t=1774433595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ROGOLF, each shot costs you points, and each coin collected increases your multiplier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/75003b64b400340e65065c466f4ed3a7.poster.avif?t=1774433595\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/75003b64b400340e65065c466f4ed3a7.webm?t=1774433595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/75003b64b400340e65065c466f4ed3a7.mp4?t=1774433595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To achieve higher and higher scores, you'll need to purchase power-ups that will allow you to lose as few points as possible and increase your multiplier ever higher!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reach the Top</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/f90b43fd70f325e7c596442bef816128.poster.avif?t=1774433595\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/f90b43fd70f325e7c596442bef816128.webm?t=1774433595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/f90b43fd70f325e7c596442bef816128.mp4?t=1774433595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accumulate enough points on each level to move from stage to stage, at each Gate, and reach the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810020?t=1774433595","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/0e7c2c5b56591f181f09aae126f589e2fa285f9e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774433595","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.stea